WEBVTT

28:37.784 --> 28:38.994
Where's the Imp?

28:42.497 --> 28:44.499
QUEEN: Where is our brother?

28:44.624 --> 28:46.376
Go and find the little beast.

28:48.753 --> 28:50.422
Tell me about Jon Arryn.

28:51.673 --> 28:53.883
One minute he was fine and then...

28:55.093 --> 28:57.846
burned right through him,
whatever it was.

28:59.014 --> 29:01.016
I loved that man.
